 "titulo": "MIEL EN YUMBILTONG",
 "fila": null,
 "contenido": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://yumbiltong.com/es/collections/miel\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Miel y Jarabes Yumbiltong\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0813/5770/1444/files/HoneySerramel500g_TraditionalPortugueseWildflowerHoney.png?v=1758833260\" /></a></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">La selección de miel de Yum Biltong reúne variedades cuidadosamente escogidas por su calidad, sabor y origen. Descubre mieles naturales ideales para acompañar desayunos, postres, infusiones o recetas, con opciones que aportan un toque dulce y auténtico a cualquier momento.</div>\n\n<div id=\"tienda-catalogo\"></div>\n<div id=\"sentinel\" style=\"height: 1px;\"></div>\n<div id=\"loader\" style=\"display: none; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">Cargando productos, por favor espera...</div>\n\n<div id=\"web-oficial-container\" style=\"display: none; margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px 0px 40px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://yumbiltong.com/es/collections/miel/?utm_source=supermercadosaliazon&utm_medium=boton_oficial&utm_campaign=catalogo_yumbiltong\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background: rgb(17, 17, 17); border-radius: 6px; color: white; display: inline-block; font-family: Helvetica Neue, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 14px 36px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;\" target=\"_blank\">Ver más en Yumbiltong</a>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n#tienda-catalogo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:20px;font-family:Arial;}\n.producto-card{border:1px solid #eaeaea;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;background:#fff;}\n.producto-card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;}\n.producto-title{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:600;}\n.producto-precio{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#111;margin:8px 0;}\n.producto-link{display:block;background:#111;color:#fff;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px;}\n.producto-club{display:block;background:#e8f0fe;color:#1a73e8;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #1a73e8;}\n</style>\n\n<script>\nvar cargando = false;\nvar hayMas = true;\nvar paginaActual = 1;\nvar SCRIPT_URL = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyfN2KHdByt6mzXBDto75m9O1lo1y6sllwr8mumgNuNaEos2K1YysF3FaTcseOfZPEHaw/exec';\nvar SCRIPT_CLICS = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbymjaZZpelLTpLoZ5t19Y_ppTRW0JH_qbOLxhUHANIH4Yk_OWzCkoXefdSRcQw3qRyu0Q/exec';\nvar FORM_URL = 'https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeWdB-lcCJ-K0nsBV6WqB-GZ2ZvA9KkTd798_4n1dmBh1tngA/viewform?usp=pp_url&entry.182236341=';\nvar COLECCION_PARAM = '&coleccion=miel';\nfunction crearTarjeta(p){\n  var sep = p.url.indexOf('?') !== -1 ? '&' : '?';\n  var urlUtm = p.url + sep + 'utm_source=supermercadosaliazon&utm_medium=tarjeta_producto&utm_campaign=catalogo_yumbiltong';\n  var urlClic = SCRIPT_CLICS + '?producto=' + encodeURIComponent(p.titulo) + '&url=' + encodeURIComponent(p.url);\n  var urlForm = FORM_URL + encodeURIComponent(p.titulo);\n  var h = '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-card' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>';\n  if(p.imagen) h += '<img src=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + p.imagen + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' loading=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'lazy' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' alt=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + p.titulo + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>';\n  h += '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-title' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + p.titulo + '</div>';\n  if(p.precio) h += '<div class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-precio' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>' + p.precio + '</div>';\n  h += '<a class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-link' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' href=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + urlUtm + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' rel=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'nofollow' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' target=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '_blank' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' onclick=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'fetch(' + String.fromCharCode(39) + urlClic + String.fromCharCode(39) + ',{mode:' + String.fromCharCode(39) + 'no-cors' + String.fromCharCode(39) + '})' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>Comprar ahora</a>';\n  h += '<a class=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + 'producto-club' + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' href=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + urlForm + String.fromCharCode(34) + ' target=' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '_blank' + String.fromCharCode(34) + '>Unirme al Club de Ahorro</a>';\n  h += '</div>';\n  return h;\n}\nfunction cargarProductos(){\n  if(cargando || !hayMas) return;\n  cargando = true;\n  document.getElementById('loader').style.display = 'block';\n  fetch(SCRIPT_URL + '?pagina=' + paginaActual + COLECCION_PARAM)\n    .then(function(r){ return r.json(); })\n    .then(function(data){\n      document.getElementById('tienda-catalogo').innerHTML += data.productos.map(crearTarjeta).join('');\n      hayMas = data.hayMas;\n      paginaActual++;\n      if(!hayMas) document.getElementById('web-oficial-container').style.display = 'block';\n      document.getElementById('loader').style.display = 'none';\n      cargando = false;\n    })\n    .catch(function(err){ console.log(err); cargando = false; document.getElementById('loader').style.display = 'none'; });\n}\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){\n  cargarProductos();\n  var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n    if(entries[0].isIntersecting){ if(cargando) return; cargarProductos(); }\n  }, {rootMargin: '250px'});\n  observer.observe(document.getElementById('sentinel'));\n});\n</script>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">SI EL ARTÍCULO ESTÁ AGOTADO O NO REALIZAN ENVÍOS A TU DESTINO, CONTÁCTANOS: <a href=\"mailto:comercialyventas@gmail.com\">comercialyventas@gmail.com</a></span></div>",
 "fecha_copia": "2026-09-26T16:18:01.077Z"
